### Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

###

### Create Enquiry
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "John Doe",
    "channel": "whatsapp",
    "message": "What are your pricing plans?"
}

###

### Get Enquiry
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1

###

### Escalate Enquiry
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reason": "Customer requested human support"
}

###

### Schedule Follow-up
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/follow-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "delay_minutes": 30,
    "message_template": "Checking if you still need assistance."
}

###

### History
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/history